    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "team_0110_select_01",
      "hash64": "C4EC46A6B601D4B2",
      "text": "How, though?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "team_0110_select_02",
      "hash64": "C4EC45A6B601D2FF",
      "text": "Where’s the big boss?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "ED0E5D614AF59A0B",
      "text": "Don’t worry—there’s no need to search them out.\\nThe true identity of the big boss...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "ED0E5C614AF59858",
      "text": "is none other than me.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_14",
      "hash64": "ED0E63614AF5A43D",
      "text": "I’m sorry...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_15",
      "hash64": "ED0E62614AF5A28A",
      "text": "I didn’t mean to keep it from you for so long, but\\nthe right moment never came.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_16",
      "hash64": "ED0E61614AF5A0D7",
      "text": "I’m the one who formed Team Star. Back then, the\\nmembers of the team were my closest friends...\\r\\nand I treasured them more than anything.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_17",
      "hash64": "ED0E60614AF59F24",
      "text": "If they go on like this, Team Star won’t do any\\ngood for anyone.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_18",
      "hash64": "ED0E57614AF58FD9",
      "text": "They’ve got to give it up. So I’m using the code\\nwe made together to force them to disband.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0110_cassiopeia_19",
      "hash64": "ED0E56614AF58E26",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\c\\nI’ll be waiting for you in the schoolyard\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]after dark[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]. You should come as well, Clive.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
